# Pre-Done Gate (Hard Stop)

Never claim a task is fixed until this gate passes.

## 1) Logic Path Matrix

For each edited method, verify:
- Success path
- Null/empty/unexpected return path
- Exception path
- Environment mode path (debug vs release), if behavior differs

## 2) Call-Site Contract Validation

For each new or changed method invocation, verify:
- Method exists in target class/service
- Parameter count/types match
- Return type handling is correct
- Async calls are properly awaited or intentionally unawaited

## 3) Security Blocking Checks

For auth/identity/config changes, verify:
- Production path fails closed on auth errors
- No mock or fallback identity in release mode
- No sensitive internal errors exposed to end users

## 4) Verification Evidence

Must include:
- Static analysis result
- Test result
- Runtime/flow validation result for changed behavior

If any item is missing, final status must be "partially fixed" or "blocked".
